    "Name": "Warwolf B",
    "Details": "An intermediate fighter, the B Configuration has a limited number of weapons, while sporting five Jump Jets. Its main gun is an Ultra Class 10 Autocannon with three tons of ammunition, all mounted in the 'Mech's right arm. The 'Mech's only offensive energy weapon is an ER Large Pulse Laser, while a head-mounted LAMS provides defense against incoming missiles. Five additional Double Heat Sinks are fitted throughout the side torsos and left arm.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Medium</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.12</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
